    <string name="key_config_label_tencent">Tencent Key (lbs.qq.com/dev/console/application/mine)</string>
    <string name="key_config_hint">Key setup:\n· Configure at least one key; SDKs without keys are skipped.\n· Baidu: create an Android SDK app with package com.tiger.locationverify and the correct signing SHA-1.\n· Amap: add an Android Key with the package name and signing SHA-1.\n· Tencent: create an application in the console and follow its authorization requirements.\n· Baidu and Amap keys are set before client creation. Tencent uses a process singleton; restart the app after changing its Key to ensure it takes effect.\nConsole links:\nhttps://lbsyun.baidu.com/apiconsole/key\nhttps://console.amap.com/dev/key/app\nhttps://lbs.qq.com/dev/console/application/mine</string>
